	"name": "Foiled by Foliage",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/tree-animated-squint.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As an action, you can take control of a nonsapient plant. Doing so temporarily grants the plant motility and your Narrator will assign awakened plant statistics, such as @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.btcvb0wfeykuojm7]{Awakened Shrub} or @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-monsters.Actor.af9jadw3v4e1y11o]{Awakened Tree}. The plant shares your initiative and can move each round at your telepathic command. By spending a bonus action on your turn, you can telepathically command the plant to take an action. This effect has a range of 60ft and a duration of 10 minutes with concentration, though during the duration you can shift your control to another nonsapient plant as an action on your turn, causing the first to return to its normal state. You can use this ability once per short or long rest.</p>",
